  "document": {
    "abstract": "This memo defines extensions to the Protocol Identifier Reference document for the identification of application verb information. It does not obsolete any portion of the Protocol Identifier Reference document. In particular, it describes the algorithms required to identify protocol operations (verbs) within the protocol encapsulations managed with the Remote Network Monitoring MIB Version 2, RFC 2021.",
